                {
                    "id": "paragraph-3-1",
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "props": {
                        "content": "Some irregular verbs are completely <strong>invariable</strong>: their base form, simple past, and past participle are identical in spelling! We rely on sentence context and time signal words to know if they refer to the present or past.",
